nav-tools - nl-engine P8 pathfinding tools (Recast/Detour 1.6.0, headless)
usage:
  nav-tools bake <in.glb|.nmesh> <out.nnav> [--cell-size F] [--cell-height F]
          [--slope F] [--agent-height F] [--agent-radius F] [--agent-climb F]
          [--min-region F] [--merge-region F]
  nav-tools dump <in.nnav>
  nav-tools wire <in.nnav> <out.png> [--size N]
  nav-tools query <in.nnav> --start x,y,z --end x,y,z
          [--max-nodes N] [--max-waypoints N]
          [--half-extents x,y,z] [--png out.png]
  nav-tools resave <in.nnav> <out.nnav>
  nav-tools debug-stage <in.glb|.nmesh> <out.png> --stage <name>
          [--size N] [--cell-size F ...]
  nav-tools selftest [--verbose]
exit codes: 0=PASS 1=failure 2=usage
